WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.320
Good morning John it is Tuesday.

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:05.080
Nope, Friday. Good morning Hank! It's a reunion videooooooo...

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:05.600
Hi

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:06.860
How are you?

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:08.280
How are.... we're...

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:12.040
Ooooooooooooooooo

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.160
Hank: We both kind of look tan

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.460
John: No I think it's cause of the bad lighting.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.580
So a very special question tuesday John.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.920
It's been nine years that we've been making vlogbrothers videos

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:25.880
I wanted to do a question tuesday in which we tell people things

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.160
that they still don't know about us.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.840
I asked Twitter and here are some of the questions that I received

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.300
Who had more girlfriends in elementary through highschool?

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.340
John: Hmmmm me!

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.600
Hank: Yes I had more girlfriends in elementary school though I will say.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.160
John: Hmm I killed it in elementary school.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.080
Hank: No you didn't!

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.640
John: I had long term relationships in elementary school.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.540
Hank: That's right I was just like hop hop hop hop hop

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.420
I held so many hands.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:47.920
John: Did you?

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:51.100
John: When you were kids did you know what you wanted to be when you grew up?

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.580
Hank: I thought that I wanted to be an oceanographer.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:56.740
But it turns out that I don't like boats.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:00.520
John: I did want to be a writer when I was a kid but I never thought that it was a realistic job

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.520
I thought it was like wanting to be an astronaut or something.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.400
What is the pettiest thing that you still argue about?

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:11.940
We did have an argument yesterday about which part of the human body would take the longest to eat.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.260
John: No I feel like the argument was about which part of the human body would make the largest contiguous steak.

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:22.580
It's all petty until you're a cannibal. And than it's suddenly very very real.

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:24.840
Hank: Gwen asks "Does John cast movies?"

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:27.540
John: No

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:30.060
Hank: "Who has bigger ears?" asks Sarah.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:32.320
John: Hmm I don't know my ears are this big.

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:33.580
Hank: My ears are this big.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.320
Hank: Let's measure with the Goonies.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:36.860
Like right here

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:37.580
John: Okay

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:38.820
Hank: I made a little mark.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:41.380
John: Alright. Then I'll go. I have the bigger ears.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:43.480
[Hank laughs]

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:44.540
But I'm older!

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:45.500
Hank: Yeah they keep growing

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:46.240
John: They keep getting bigger.

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:50.820
Henry is right behind the camera and uh I just asked him if the video was funny

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:54.340
and he said no so I'm concerned so Hank can you do something funny?

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.960
[Hank makes fart sounds]

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:57.920
[All laugh]

00:01:58.700 --> 00:01:59.980
John: He laughed!

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:02.120
[Hank makes more fart noises]

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:02.960
[Henry laughs]

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:04.340
John: Alright the video is funny again.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:06.640
Hank: Bubble baths. Soothing relaxation

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:07.380
John: Yes

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:08.380
Hank: or boiling cesspool

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.000
John: Ohhh

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:09.820
Hank: Boiling cesspool.

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:15.580
John: Nooo Nooo Nooo Noo! We're about to have the pettiest argument we've ever had.

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:16.080
[Hank laughs]

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:17.160
John: Baths are wonderful!

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:21.360
Hank: It feels like putting my entire body on every other part of my body.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:23.580
Ainsley asks: Nerdfighter emoji?

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:26.420
There are, there is one that I use

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:27.120
John: Is it this one?

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.440
Hank: Yes the lady who is going like this.

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.420
John: Hank what is your 20 year goal?

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:34.440
Hank: Ooohh when I'm 55...I wanna still have a colon.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:35.680
[John laughs]

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:36.520
John: How is Dave Green?

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.240
Hank: Fine. He's doing good.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:40.120
John: Whenever I'm like "How are you doing?" he's just like

00:02:40.120 --> 00:02:41.200
Hank: Living the dream!

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.380
John: L T D !

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.780
Hank: He does say that it's weird.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.520
John: I don't think it's that weird I think it's cool.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.820
Hank: I keep thinking it's FTD which is the flower delivery service.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:51.840
Have you ever seen each other poop?

00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:55.540
John: Hahahahaha Henry is finally laughing again.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:59.360
Probably when yeah..Hank was like three months old but it's been a while.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.020
Hank: Rapid fire. What's your favourite musical?

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:01.720
John: Hamilton.

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:02.780
Hank: What's your favourite poem?

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.500
John: The second coming by W. B. Yeats.

00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:06.380
Hank: What book have you reread more than any other?

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:11.500
John: Puhhh actually probaby Hatchet by Gary Paulsen if you go back to my childhood.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:14.980
John: Last question Hank. What do you think of as your biggest accomplishment?

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:18.240
When you do that it makes shadow animals on my body.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.160
[Hank makes duck noises]

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:22.860
John: Is this your biggest accomplishment right now? This? Making a terrible duck

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.080
that kisses me on the cheek?

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:27.580
My biggest professional accomplishment is vlogbrothers. Uhm my biggest personal

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.540
personal accomplishment is uhm behind the camera.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:31.460
Hank: You picked Henry?!

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:33.560
John: No I mean.. but I...

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.160
Hank: I also am really proud of vlogbrothers, of course.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:40.680
But among that in there I think my greatest accomplishment is having made the internet's

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:42.900
most viewed video of a goat giving birth.

00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:44.540
It's a thing that I did

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:46.380
John: It's incredible

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.500
Hank: No one can take that away from me.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.420
John: I'll see you on friday.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:51.320
Tuesday.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.360
I'm so bad at days.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.140
Hank: Yeah I know.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:57.240
I know. It's gonna be a problem for our whole lives.

